sentences.text:
Let the applicant Prashant Kumar @ Shani be released on bail inCase Crime no. 497 of 2022, under Sections 363/366, 120 B, 376 D.A. 323, 506, 344 I.P.C. and Section 5/6 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012, registered at Police Station Lalganj, District Raebareli on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions: -
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.

